   ->  Merge Join
         Merge Cond: (t2.a = t1.a)
         ->  Merge Left Join
               Merge Cond: (t2.a = t3.a)
               ->  Index Scan using i2 on t2
               ->  Materialize
                     ->  Index Scan using i3 on t3
         ->  Materialize
               ->  Nested Loop
                     ->  Index Scan using i1 on t1
                     ->  Materialize
                           ->  Broadcast Motion 3:3  (slice2; segments: 3)
                                 ->  Seq Scan on t4
 Optimizer: Postgres-based planner
(15 rows)

